      "description": "SPCT-led, 4-day SAFe Practice Consultant (SPC) certification course with the full 5-dimensional Implementing SAFe operating model embedded. Authorises graduates to train and coach Agile Release Trains, facilitate PI Planning, and lead large-scale SAFe transformations.",
